{"seq":43,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0692"},"reason":"The body said that from 153 BC 'January became the first month of the year'. Roman writers place January at the head of the calendar much earlier (under Numa or the Decemvirs, c. 450 BC); what changed in 153 BC is that the consuls entered office on 1 January (Livy, Periochae 47.13), so 1 January became the start of the official (consular) year. Sentence reworded in EN/DE/RU.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.livius.org/sources/content/livy/livy-periochae-46-50/"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/January"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",448],["-","and"],["+","which"],["=",1],["-","January"],["+","thus"],["=",7],["-","month"],["+","day"],["=",5],["+","official "],["=",613]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",450],["-","und "],["=",2],["-","Januar"],["+","damit"],["=",1],["-","wurde "],["=",4],["-","Monat"],["+","Tag"],["=",3],["-","Jahres."],["+","Amtsjahres"],["=",1],["+","wurde. "],["=",603]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",390],["-","и"],["+","которое"],["=",1],["-","январь"],["+","тем"],["=",1],["-","стал"],["+","самым"],["=",1],["+","стало "],["=",2],["-","месяцем"],["+","днём"],["=",1],["+","официального "],["=",591]]}],"hash":"3a3a021a82d0","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"470193c671f81a2518f9d12db13fa7238be0f748eeafa0ad7dc1783eb8ec4f94"},
{"seq":44,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"marked","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f20360"},"reason":"Answer mark moved because the article text around it was corrected during the provenance re-research; the answer is unchanged.","by":"provenance-research","changes":[{"field":"spans","old":{"en":[1551,4],"de":[1748,4],"ru":[1515,4]},"new":{"en":[1557,4],"de":[1745,4],"ru":[1535,4]}}],"hash":"19094ff3843e","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"eecf2e968f0147cfd43a3020a9cfee538cc90eab5ae60a04cf710695c90b5322"},
{"seq":45,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f20361"},"reason":"Timeline label said 1 January became 'the first day of the year'; narrowed to 'the first day of the official year' (the consular year), matching Livy, Periochae 47.13 and the corrected body.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.livius.org/sources/content/livy/livy-periochae-46-50/"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/January"}],"changes":[{"field":"timeline","old":{"labelEn":"Roman consuls begin taking office on 1 January, which becomes the first day of the year","labelDe":"Die römischen Konsuln treten ihr Amt erstmals am 1. Januar an, der zum ersten Tag des Jahres wird","labelRu":"Римские консулы начинают вступать в должность 1 января, ставшего первым днём года"},"new":{"labelEn":"Roman consuls begin taking office on 1 January, which becomes the first day of the official year","labelDe":"Die römischen Konsuln treten ihr Amt erstmals am 1. Januar an, der zum ersten Tag des Amtsjahres wird","labelRu":"Римские консулы начинают вступать в должность 1 января, ставшего первым днём официального года"}}],"hash":"44949f78d7ec","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"afa21fc0f9f7fd579ee2691e5deaac5c95ec4713a037ccaf87724d7351a5158d"},
{"seq":46,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w20361"},"reason":"The question's premise 'making January the first month of the year' is contestable (January already headed the calendar since c. 450 BC by most Roman accounts); the question now says the official year began on 1 January from then on, which is what the consuls' change of office date did. Answer unchanged (153 BC).","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.livius.org/sources/content/livy/livy-periochae-46-50/"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/January"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"From which year did the Roman consuls take office on 1 January, making January the first month of the year?","new":"From which year did the Roman consuls take office on 1 January, so that the official year began on that day?"},{"field":"de","old":"Ab welchem Jahr traten die römischen Konsuln ihr Amt am 1. Januar an, wodurch der Januar zum ersten Monat des Jahres wurde?","new":"Ab welchem Jahr traten die römischen Konsuln ihr Amt am 1. Januar an, sodass das Amtsjahr an diesem Tag begann?"},{"field":"ru","old":"С какого года римские консулы вступали в должность 1 января, благодаря чему январь стал первым месяцем года?","new":"С какого года римские консулы вступали в должность 1 января, так что официальный год начинался в этот день?"}],"hash":"7ea64daa1bed","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"148fa99fe44f3e29483c2c7abcf0ec3774d538c29bf24242469d8a68d2e1654a"},
